WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.633
Has this agency worked where you need to be heard?

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:11.017
Parley is an imaginary London agency, and its website shows the work by region.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:13.650
Each case study starts with a place.

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:20.750
Open one for the region, the services, the duration and the sample results.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:31.350
Then write in, in confidence. Each message is kept as a private record in WordPress.

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:40.017
41 stylesheets are joined into one as the image is built.

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:47.317
The menu and carousels work without the script, and one seed fills the site on each deploy.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:52.500
Pick a region and read the work, at parley.junaid.guru.
